<p>Hits the target with two shield strikes, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">131%, 144%, 154%, 162%, 170%</acronym> and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">160%, 176%, 189%, 200%, 210%</acronym> shield damage. If it hits a second time, it stuns the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The stun chance increases with your Accuracy and your Strength.</p>